{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113003","id":3032135748,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc60urhE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113003","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113003.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113003.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113003","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113003/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113003/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113003/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8472085a5ea6ed9bf7b95ca1a5eb19e625af0211","number":113003,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve TAA Edge Handling","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Prevents objects from seeing local pixel wide expansions and contractions to it's edges while in motion.\r\n\r\nMoving Object that are viewed through a child Camera are the easiest to observe this phenomenon with clearly.\r\n\r\n**Method Explanation**\r\nThis works by taking Two histories in to account.\r\n1) The Raw Motion Vector History, which can hit between Samples\r\n2) Pixel Centered Motion Vector History, which takes the Closest Sample\r\n\r\nIt clips Both of them to the Same Standard, resulting in Two possible History Clips.\r\n1) Raw History is sharp but may suffer the Edge Issue\r\n2) Pixel Centered History is slightly blurry but doesn't suffer the Edge Issue\r\n\r\nIf the two values differ too much the history value of the Pixel Centered History is taken as Correct.\r\nThe Threshold for determining this has to be high enough to prevent the slight sharpness differences from triggering it, but low enough for the difference in results of the Edges in the Clipped Histories to be detected.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-21T01:26:18Z","updated_at":"2025-11-22T10:09:36Z","closed_at":"2025-11-22T08:50:40Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"95b6278fe039dc754146b46558f7cb8d72414ebf","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"mrjustaguy:TAA-Edge","re